  "answer": "On this Linux worktree the shipped Claude Code binary was present at /home/prekzursil/.local/bin/claude. The frozen CLI hooks reference names 31 events; the Agent SDK page names 31. A logging command hook was fired once per CLI event and stored the verbatim stdin JSON (field hook_event_name). Exit 2 returns a blocking error: PreToolUse is blocked by the published table, SessionStart is not. Exit 0 JSON injects additionalContext via hookSpecificOutput. A 30s hook under a 0.6s timeout is canceled without waiting out the sleep; command-family PreToolUse timeout does not block. Live session firing of the Claude Code UI/CLI remains NOT-CHECKED. SUCCESS:RES-0009 in the receipt AND one captured raw payload per supported event plus an observed block/inject/timeout transcript",
